# book.spreads — the ordered list of sections in this book.
#
# One spread file per line, in page order. Paths are relative to the project
# root. Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored, so group/comment
# freely. This is the ONLY file you edit to wire up sections — the build
# scripts read it via _build.load_spreads().
#
# Each spread file contains one or more <div class="page"> blocks; the build
# numbers pages globally in the order listed here. Saddle-stitch binding wants
# an EVEN total page count (master-build.py warns if it's odd).
#
# Replace these stubs with your real sections.

# Opening: LOGO → BLANK → TITLE (3 unnumbered front-matter pages, all in one file).
# Counted in book.config front_matter_pages = 3.
src/spreads/01-title.html
src/spreads/02-photo-spread.html
src/spreads/03-color-spread.html

# Cross-gutter photo: ONE image spanning both facing pages. Must start on an even
# (LEFT-hand/verso) page — here it lands on page 8. Prep the image with
# scripts/spread-photo.py; see src/spreads/04-spread-photo.html.
src/spreads/04-spread-photo.html
